@startuml tenant-creation-enterprise
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white

title Enterprise Tenant Creation Flow

|Trigger|
start
:GitHub Actions
workflow_dispatch;
note right
  Parameters:
  - environment: enterprise
  - action: apply
  - tenant_number: 1
  - tenant_name: "acme-corp"
end note

|Terraform|
:Create Full Infrastructure;
note right
  **Dedicated Resources:**
  - GKE Cluster (tripico-acme-corp-cluster)
  - VPC Network (tripico-acme-corp-network)
  - Static IP (dedicated)
  - DNS Wildcard (*.acme-corp.tripico.fun)
  - Identity Platform Tenant (ent-acme-corp)
  - Storage Bucket (dedicated)
  - Workload Identity Bindings
  - NGINX Ingress Controller
  - API Gateway Configuration
  - State: terraform/state/acme-corp
end note

|Deployment|
:Connect to Enterprise Cluster;
:Deploy All Services;
note right
  gcloud container clusters get-credentials
    tripico-acme-corp-cluster --region europe-west1

  helm upgrade --install itinerary-service
    --set identityPlatform.tenantId=<tenant-id>
    -f values-enterprise-prod.yaml

  **Including dedicated:**
  - weather-service
  - travel-warnings-service
end note

|Result|
:Tenant Ready;
note right
  Frontend: acme-corp.tripico.fun
  API: itinerary.acme-corp.tripico.fun
end note

stop

@enduml
